     "type": "text",
     "text": "{\"count\": 2, \"rationale\": \"The target crown:obtain (OR) can be reached through h4_3:obtain or h4_0:pivot. h4_3:obtain (OR) is fed by h2_1:obtain, which comes directly from entry footholds, and also by h2_2:escalate. h4_0:pivot needs h3_3:obtain, an AND of h2_1, h2_0 and h2_2, and all three are reachable. No single block works. Blocking h4_3 leaves h4_0 open through h3_3. Blocking h4_0 or h3_3 leaves h4_3 open through h2_1. Blocking h2_1 leaves h4_3 open through h2_2 (via h1_3 or h1_0). Blocking h2_2 leaves h4_3 open through h2_1. Blocking h2_1 and h4_3 together works: without h2_1 the AND step h3_3 fails, so h4_0 fails, and h4_3 is blocked directly. The minimum is therefore 2.\"}"
    }
